BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:City of Fairfax Early Childhood Arts Program
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T111500
DTSTAMP:20261126T152932Z
UID:city-of-fairfax-early-childhood-arts-program-20260928@fairfax-city
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.fairfaxva.gov/files/assets/city/v/1/
 parks-amp-rec/images/cultural-arts/cultural-arts/cof_earlychildhoodartspro
 gram_logo_color.jpg?dimension=smallthumbnail&w=150&h=100
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture
DESCRIPTION:This program introduces children ages 2 - 5 to the joy of the 
 arts through engaging\, age-appropriate live performances and experiences.
   Performances take place two Mondays per month.\n\nClass size is limited 
 and pre-registration is required.\n\nDetails: https://www.fairfaxva.gov/Ev
 ents-directory/Parks-and-Recreation/Cultural-Arts/City-of-Fairfax-Early-Ch
 ildhood-Arts-Program
LOCATION:Stacy C. Sherwood Center\, 3740 Blenheim Blvd.\, Fairfax\, VA 
 22030
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.fairfaxva.gov/Events-directory/Parks-and-Recreation/Cultur
 al-Arts/City-of-Fairfax-Early-Childhood-Arts-Program
END:VEVENT
