 sustainability/images/leaf-collection.png?dimension=smallthumbnail&w=150&h
 =100
CATEGORIES:Community & Special Events
DESCRIPTION:City of Fairfax fall leaf collection runs Nov. 2 through Dec. 
 31\, 2026. Learn how curbside vacuum-leaf pickup works by zone\, how to ra
 ke loose leaves to the curb\, what yard debris is allowed\, and why bagged
  leaves are not collected. Includes yard waste rules and a contact number 
 for questions.\n\nDetails: https://www.fairfaxva.gov/Events-directory/Envi
 ronment-Sustainability/Fall-Leaf-Collection
LOCATION:City of Fairfax\, VA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.fairfaxva.gov/Events-directory/Environment-Sustainability/
 Fall-Leaf-Collection
